  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe in Lebanon - phase 2 : Promoting health and wellbeing in communities prone to irregular migration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SAFE project aims to address the key drivers of irregular migration from Lebanon in high-risk communities, focusing on access to health services, including mental health and psychosocial support. It will also build the evidence base on &#x201c;what works&#x201d; to address irregular migration by evaluating IOM&#x2019;s prevention interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
